  "releaseNotes": "Added infrastructure test coverage for dependency injection, request creation,\n            request sending, and response handling.\n            Added application test coverage for DomainBuilder, ID validation, integer overloads,\n            and service registration.\n            Tightened DomainBuilder validation and expanded integer ID support by allowing int\n            inputs that normalize to long.\n            Improved client request safeguards, including broader ID enforcement and user-agent\n            and option validation behavior.\n            Removed legacy HintPath references in favor of proper project references.",
